  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:01.010" end="00:06.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Huh (huh), huh (huh), huh, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:06.390" end="00:10.850" ttm:agent="v1">Hmm, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:10.850" end="00:13.620" ttm:agent="v1">Uh-huh, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:13.620" end="00:17.220" ttm:agent="v1">Yo' ho tryna hit this, I guess I could take one too</p>
      <p begin="00:17.220" end="00:20.640" ttm:agent="v1">I don't think I could take much more, it ain't right if I fake what's true</p>
      <p begin="00:20.640" end="00:23.980" ttm:agent="v1">If I looked in the mirror and saw yo' ass, I probably would hate me too</p>
      <p begin="00:23.980" end="00:27.440" ttm:agent="v1">I got pedal to metal, this car go fast, she like when I make that vroom</p>
      <p begin="00:27.440" end="00:29.280" ttm:agent="v1">She like, &quot;ian, what you made this month?&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:29.280" end="00:30.940" ttm:agent="v1">I'm like, &quot;Bae, let me give you a estimate&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:30.940" end="00:34.440" ttm:agent="v1">If I had much less than I had right now, I'd probably retire forever still</p>
      <p begin="00:34.440" end="00:37.890" ttm:agent="v1">Inside my chest, I'm doubling down, it's too late to look for the exit</p>
      <p begin="00:37.890" end="00:41.390" ttm:agent="v1">Finna hit that ground so goddamn hard, nobody will ever come catch me</p>
      <p begin="00:41.390" end="00:44.850" ttm:agent="v1">I'm just tryna be myself, I got everybody mad at me for it</p>
      <p begin="00:44.850" end="00:48.340" ttm:agent="v1">I hit the beat so hard, they give me assault plus battery for it</p>
      <p begin="00:48.340" end="00:51.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">This an expensive car, ten times whatever yo' salary is (huh)</p>
      <p begin="00:51.610" end="00:55.030" ttm:agent="v1">These is some big-ass pockets, I probably should get 'em a salad or somethin'</p>
      <p begin="00:55.030" end="00:58.360" ttm:agent="v1">Yo' ho tryna hit this, I guess I could take one too</p>
      <p begin="00:58.360" end="01:01.850" ttm:agent="v1">I don't think I could take much more, it ain't right if I fake what's true</p>
      <p begin="01:01.850" end="01:05.050" ttm:agent="v1">If I looked in the mirror and saw yo' ass, I probably would hate me too</p>
      <p begin="01:05.050" end="01:08.410" ttm:agent="v1">I got pedal to metal, this car go fast, she like when I make that vroom</p>
      <p begin="01:08.410" end="01:11.870" ttm:agent="v1">Pass it off, M-Magic trick, money tall than Magic Johnson</p>
      <p begin="01:11.870" end="01:15.300" ttm:agent="v1">I don't see no funds involved, so you can't get attention from me</p>
      <p begin="01:15.300" end="01:18.790" ttm:agent="v1">Big bro got one hundred, uh, you first up in contention for 'em</p>
      <p begin="01:18.790" end="01:22.160" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gon' keep my head up high 'til someone come and take it from me</p>
      <p begin="01:22.160" end="01:25.280" ttm:agent="v1">It's hard for me to stress when I got payment comin' in</p>
      <p begin="01:25.280" end="01:28.970" ttm:agent="v1">Keep beggin' for that sauce, they somethin' like Plankton with the shit</p>
      <p begin="01:28.970" end="01:32.020" ttm:agent="v1">Not worried 'bout the distance, private plane to see that bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:32.020" end="01:36.120" ttm:agent="v1">Thought we had somethin' goin', such a shame to see that end</p>
      <p begin="01:36.120" end="01:39.470" ttm:agent="v1">Yo' ho tryna hit this, I guess I could take one too</p>
      <p begin="01:39.470" end="01:43.060" ttm:agent="v1">I don't think I could take much more, it ain't right if I fake what's true</p>
      <p begin="01:43.060" end="01:46.340" ttm:agent="v1">If I looked in the mirror and saw yo' ass, I probably would hate me too</p>
      <p begin="01:46.340" end="01:49.560" ttm:agent="v1">I got pedal to metal, this car go fast, she like when I make that vroom</p>
      <p begin="01:49.560" end="01:53.010" ttm:agent="v1">Pass it off, M-Magic trick, money tall than Magic Johnson</p>
      <p begin="01:53.010" end="01:56.460" ttm:agent="v1">I don't see no funds involved, so you can't get attention from me</p>
      <p begin="01:56.460" end="01:59.980" ttm:agent="v1">Big bro got one hundred, uh, you first up in contention for 'em</p>
      <p begin="01:59.980" end="02:04.760" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gon' keep my head up high 'til someone come and take it from me</p>
      <p begin="02:04.760" end="02:08.450" ttm:agent="v1">And she like when I make that vroom</p>
      <p begin="02:08.450" end="02:11.230" ttm:agent="v1">And she like when I make that vroom</p>
      <p begin="02:11.230" end="02:15.230" ttm:agent="v1">♪</p>
    </div>
